<section class="challenge" id="challenge">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="challenge-header">
      <div class="section-label">The Challenge</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Institutions Are Facing a<br><em style="font-style:italic;">Human Systems Transition</em></h2>
      <p class="section-desc">The pace of AI development has outrun most institutional capacity to absorb, govern, and respond meaningfully. The challenge is not technological — it is human, organizational, and systemic.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="challenge-grid">
      <div class="challenge-card">
        <span class="challenge-num">01</span>
        <svg class="challenge-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13h18M5 17h14a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
        <h3>AI Transition Complexity</h3>
        <p>Institutions across higher education, public services, and international organizations face compounding pressures from AI adoption that outpace existing governance structures, decision-making frameworks, and human capacity to adapt.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="challenge-card">
        <span class="challenge-num">02</span>
        <svg class="challenge-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253"/></svg>
        <h3>Digital Literacy Challenges</h3>
        <p>Uneven levels of digital and AI literacy create institutional fragility. When staff, faculty, and leadership lack shared frameworks for understanding AI, strategic coherence erodes and institutional risk increases significantly.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="challenge-card">
        <span class="challenge-num">03</span>
        <svg class="challenge-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M3 6l3 1m0 0l-3 9a5.002 5.002 0 006.001 0M6 7l3 9M6 7l6-2m6 2l3-1m-3 1l-3 9a5.002 5.002 0 006.001 0M18 7l3 9m-3-9l-6-2m0-2v2m0 16V5m0 16H9m3 0h3"/></svg>
        <h3>Human Oversight &amp; Governance</h3>
        <p>Meaningful human oversight of AI systems requires more than policy. It demands the cultivation of judgment, critical capacity, and institutional cultures that can hold complexity — capacities that take time and intentional investment to build.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="challenge-card">
        <span class="challenge-num">04</span>
        <svg class="challenge-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4"/></svg>
        <h3>Institutional Resilience Pressures</h3>
        <p>Organizations are simultaneously expected to innovate faster, operate leaner, and maintain public trust — often without adequate investment in the human infrastructure that makes resilience possible during periods of systemic disruption.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

