        <div class="why-item">
          <h4>Accelerating AI Adoption Without Readiness Infrastructure</h4>
          <p>Institutions are being asked to integrate AI tools into core operations faster than they can develop the literacy, governance structures, and human capacity to do so safely and strategically.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-item">
          <h4>Human Judgment Under Systemic Complexity</h4>
          <p>When AI mediates decisions and information flows, the quality of human judgment becomes more consequential, not less. Protecting and developing judgment capacity is a strategic institutional imperative.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-item">
          <h4>Governance and Oversight Challenges</h4>
          <p>Regulatory frameworks, ethical guidelines, and organizational policies are all lagging behind actual AI deployment. Institutions that invest now in governance literacy will navigate emerging requirements with greater agility.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="why-col">
        <div class="why-item">
          <h4>Institutional Uncertainty and Fragility</h4>
          <p>AI transition amplifies existing institutional tensions — around authority, trust, transparency, and accountability. Unaddressed, these tensions reduce cohesion and increase operational risk at precisely the moment when coherence matters most.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-item">
          <h4>Future Readiness as Competitive Positioning</h4>
          <p>Institutions that build genuine AI literacy and resilient human systems now will be significantly better positioned for partnership, funding, and leadership opportunities as the governance landscape matures globally.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-item">
          <h4>Responsible Innovation as Institutional Identity</h4>
          <p>Increasingly, institutional stakeholders — students, staff, funders, and regulators — expect organizations to demonstrate not just AI adoption, but responsible, thoughtful, and human-centered approaches to AI integration.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

